      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Figure on the Insert tab places an image with a caption; relative paths are resolved against the document's folder, and a missing image shows as a labelled placeholder instead of breaking the build. Drawing and the Flowchart builder (Ctrl+Shift+F), in the same group, draw simple diagrams without leaving the editor.",
