          "text": "The Layout tab sets the margins, the page size and one, two or three columns, and reflows everything at once. Document type switches between article, report, book, the journal classes and the rest; the page you type on takes the fonts, headings and spacing of the PDF that type prints. File > Document properties holds the font, font size and line spacing, and Insert > Multi-column region puts a two-column block inside a single-column page.",
