            "code"
          ],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "text": ", Word (.docx), PDF and Markdown files. Anything the editor does not understand is kept as a raw LaTeX block, so an imported file can be exported again without losing content. File > Export writes .tex, .docx or .pdf.",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "alignment": "justify",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Tools > Compiler chooses between the LaTeX engine and Typst, and ",
